{
 "about": "At-the-time grades are written once and kept (grade.freeze, titles_dec). A batch here re-grades its decisions once, the next time the pipeline runs, with the same point-in-time models (projections and pick curves as of each move's date) and today's corrected inputs; the new grade is then frozen like any other, and the old one kept beside it (frozen_at_time.json 'was'). Add a batch only for a fix to what a grade was computed from, never to a model; never remove one.",
